From: nuubOS <nuubos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] nuubos: send new surfaces the HDMI-capped scale

labwc tells a new layer-shell or xdg surface its fractional scale before
the surface enters the scene, using the raw output scale. A client that
renders once (the Quick Menu) then kept that scale. Use
wlr_fractional_scale_v1_output_scale() (nuubOS wlroots patch 0001), the
same capped value the scene sends later.

Signed-off-by: nuubOS
---
--- a/src/layers.c	2026-10-09 21:03:36.802164323 +0200
+++ b/src/layers.c	2026-10-09 21:03:36.819813046 +0200
@@ -684,8 +684,9 @@
 
 	struct output *output = layer_surface->output->data;
 
+	/* nuubOS: capped on HDMI, like the scene's preferred scale */
 	wlr_fractional_scale_v1_notify_scale(layer_surface->surface,
-		output->wlr_output->scale);
+		wlr_fractional_scale_v1_output_scale(output->wlr_output));
 
 	struct wlr_scene_tree *selected_layer =
 		output->layer_tree[layer_surface->current.layer];
--- a/src/xdg.c	2026-10-09 21:03:36.802230036 +0200
+++ b/src/xdg.c	2026-10-09 21:03:36.819868137 +0200
@@ -1033,8 +1033,9 @@
 	 */
 	view_set_output(view, output_nearest_to_cursor());
 	if (output_is_usable(view->output)) {
+		/* nuubOS: capped on HDMI, like the scene's preferred scale */
 		wlr_fractional_scale_v1_notify_scale(xdg_surface->surface,
-			view->output->wlr_output->scale);
+			wlr_fractional_scale_v1_output_scale(view->output->wlr_output));
 	}
 
 	view->workspace = server.workspaces.current;
